sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User screen
  participant C as lib/api.ts (client)
  participant G as Express gateway
  participant R as Route handler
  participant P as profile.ts
  participant E as Engine (e.g. taxFiling)
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  Note over U,DB: READ path — opening the Tax page
  U->>C: open /tax
  C-->>U: render cached value instantly (SWR)
  C->>G: GET /v1/tax/full  (Bearer access token)
  G->>G: CORS · rate limit · verify JWT
  G->>R: pass to insights route
  R->>P: loadProfileData(userId)
  P->>DB: read user + profile + last 3 months txns
  DB-->>P: raw data (paise)
  P-->>R: assembled ProfileData
  R->>E: fullFiling(profile)
  E-->>R: computed ITR (deterministic)
  R-->>C: JSON
  C->>C: update cache + re-render
  C-->>U: fresh, correct numbers

  Note over U,DB: WRITE path — marking an action done
  U->>C: POST /v1/actions/:id/complete
  C->>G: request (auth)
  G->>R: actions route
  R->>DB: update profile (assets/tax_data)
  R->>P: recalculateAndStoreScore(trigger)
  P->>DB: INSERT score_history snapshot
  R-->>C: ok
  C->>C: bust cache (next read is fresh)
  C-->>U: "Profile updated" toast + new score
